﻿1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.680
Dudo que ella siquiera respire

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.200
the same air as me.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.720
Not to mention, stay with me

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.040
24/7.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.640
If persuasion doesn't work,

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.320
manipulate her.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.320
Find her weak points.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.400
The mansion?

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.480
That’s the most reliable option.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.360
So...

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.440
You weren't planning to sell

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.800
the estate?

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:41.800
No.
